    {
      "id": "inside-temptations",
      "title": "Inside: why we're tempted",
      "height": 580,
      "items": [
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_intro",
          "shape": "ellipse",
          "x": 280,
          "y": 40,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Intelligence is doing; consciousness is being",
          "size": "md",
          "detail": "Nagel: 'something it is like to be' an organism — a different property from problem-solving.",
          "block": "spya-nj888h"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_a1",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 150,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Anthropocentrism: human as template",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Taking the human example as definitional rather than one case among many.",
          "block": "spya-h4mwb2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_a2",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 250,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Exceptionalism & anthropomorphism",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Placing humans atop every hierarchy, then projecting human traits onto machines.",
          "block": "spya-her4zk"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_b1",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 280,
          "y": 150,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Language especially triggers belief",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "LLMs, not protein-folders like AlphaFold, get called conscious — because they talk.",
          "block": "spya-k6fpme"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_b2",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 280,
          "y": 250,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "'Hallucinate' implies felt experience",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Better word: 'confabulate' — doing, not experiencing.",
          "block": "spya-t29n67"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_c1",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 520,
          "y": 150,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Exponential growth feels imminent",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "On an exponential curve, every point feels like an inflection point.",
          "block": "spya-cke6sj"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_c2",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 520,
          "y": 250,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Techno-rapture: Promethean immortality",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Ex Machina: 'that's the history of Gods' — the lure of building minds forever.",
          "block": "spya-v4sduf"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_c3",
          "shape": "box",
          "x": 520,
          "y": 350,
          "w": 200,
          "h": 70,
          "text": "Silicon Valley incentives amplify it",
          "size": "sm",
          "detail": "Magical AI narratives help justify valuations and salaries too.",
          "block": "spya-mcaa4g"
        },
        {
          "kind": "node",
          "id": "t_hub",
          "shape": "hex",
          "x": 240,
          "y": 460,
          "w": 280,
          "h": 80,
          "text": "Recognizing pareidolia is only step one",
          "size": "md",
          "detail": "Seeing why we're fooled doesn't yet tell us whether artificial consciousness is possible.",
          "block": "spya-k850tu"
        },
